I've been totally played.

1202
01:11:20.760 --> 01:11:22.720
Maybe they were both Traitors
and they agreed

1203
01:11:22.720 --> 01:11:24.760
that they'd win the game together.

1204
01:11:24.760 --> 01:11:25.800
Who knows?

1205
01:11:32.840 --> 01:11:35.000
HE SNIFFS

1206
01:11:35.000 --> 01:11:36.080
You did it.

1207
01:11:38.640 --> 01:11:39.720
Oh. my God.

1208
01:11:39.720 --> 01:11:46.600
You have each got £47.875.

1209
01:11:48.040 --> 01:11:50.520
Go on. cuddle each other.

1210
01:11:50.520 --> 01:11:52.920
Oh. my God!

1211
01:11:52.920 --> 01:11:54.400
Oh. my!

1212
01:11:56.320 --> 01:11:58.240
I thought when you weren't
looking me in the eye

1213
01:11:58.240 --> 01:12:00.760
that you'd just decided to change
your mind at the last minute.

1214
01:12:00.760 --> 01:12:02.440
I was just pulling your leg.

1215
01:12:02.440 --> 01:12:04.040
Don't do that!

1216
01:12:04.040 --> 01:12:06.080
STEPHEN LAUGHS

1217
01:12:06.080 --> 01:12:07.920
I'll be honest. I had moments

1218
01:12:07.920 --> 01:12:12.000
where I was doubting what
I was going to do tonight. but...

1219
01:12:13.320 --> 01:12:16.240
..I had...I couldn't go back on
my word to you.

1220
01:12:16.240 --> 01:12:17.480
It just wasn't worth the money

1221
01:12:17.480 --> 01:12:21.720
and I couldn't have walked out
of here by lying to you.

1222
01:12:21.720 --> 01:12:26.560
- Two Traitors. but totally
faithful to each other.
- Oh!

1223
01:12:26.560 --> 01:12:29.080
- Yeah.
- You did it.
You absolutely did it.

1224
01:12:29.080 --> 01:12:30.760
Congratulations.

1225
01:12:30.760 --> 01:12:32.880
- I'm so proud of you. honestly.
- I'm very proud of you.

1226
01:12:32.880 --> 01:12:36.560
- I'm so proud of you.
- Oh. I love you.
- Oh. I love you. too.

1227
01:12:38.800 --> 01:12:40.840
STEPHEN LAUGHS

1228
01:12:43.440 --> 01:12:46.440
I can't believe I've just won
The Traitors.

1229
01:12:47.840 --> 01:12:49.560
I'm just a wee boy from
the Isle of Lewis.

1230
01:12:49.560 --> 01:12:52.440
This kind of stuff doesn't really
happen to me.

1231
01:12:54.560 --> 01:13:00.120
This isn't the kind of money that me
and my family deal with. you know?

1232
01:13:00.120 --> 01:13:02.040
It's going to make such
a difference

1233
01:13:02.040 --> 01:13:04.560
and I just know they're going to be
so proud.

1234
01:13:16.880 --> 01:13:19.640
It's the best feeling in the world.

1235
01:13:21.480 --> 01:13:24.040
I really thought it was such
a big achievement

1236
01:13:24.040 --> 01:13:27.160
to be the first female Traitor
to make it to the final.

1237
01:13:27.160 --> 01:13:28.720
Oh. my goodness.

1238
01:13:28.720 --> 01:13:30.120
And then to win...

1239
01:13:31.120 --> 01:13:34.800
CORK POPS
THEY CHEER

1240
01:13:34.800 --> 01:13:38.880
{\an8}I think it will be a very long time
until you get the smile off my face.

1241
01:13:38.880 --> 01:13:40.160
{\an8}To the Traitors!

1242
01:13:40.160 --> 01:13:42.560
To the Traitors!

1243
01:13:42.560 --> 01:13:44.760
CLAUDIA SCREAMS

1244
01:13:42.560 --> 01:13:44.760
I've been dying to say that.

1245
01:13:44.760 --> 01:13:46.840
I'm really looking forward
to not having to lie.

1246
01:13:48.240 --> 01:13:50.840
That's a lot. That's a lot of lying.

1247
01:13:50.840 --> 01:13:53.440
So I'm looking forward
to just breathing

1248
01:13:53.440 --> 01:13:55.480
{\an8}and just making the nicest
memories with my mum

1249
01:13:55.480 --> 01:13:58.280
{\an8}that I will remember forever.

1250
01:13:58.280 --> 01:14:01.360
We are the Traitors!

1251
01:14:01.360 --> 01:14:03.760
THEY CHEER

1252
01:14:03.760 --> 01:14:05.560
- Yes!
- Come on!
